## Base URL of the ASP.NET Core backend (FingerPrint.Presentation).
## Real endpoints are only used for authentication (/api/auth/*) today -
## see docs/api/frontend-requirements.md for what else the backend needs to expose.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5830

## "mock" (default) serves the full Customer Care / Ticket Routing domain from an
## in-memory mock service so the UI can be built/reviewed before the backend
## implements departments-on-ticket, multi-employee assignment, transfer,
## collaboration requests, the customer portal and telephony/PBX endpoints.
## Set to "real" once those endpoints exist on the backend.
VITE_API_MODE=mock
